%
% A TSTP derivation produced by OUR OWN native reasoner — no external prover was
% involved. Source problem:
%   conformance/logic/cases/external/tptp-mini/theorem-subclass/source/problem.p
%   (a ⊑ b, b ⊑ c ⊢ a ⊑ c; SZS status Theorem)
%
% How it was produced:
%   1. `gmeow_conformance::external::tptp::parse_tptp` parses the problem.
%   2. `gmeow_conformance::external::tptp::lower_to_fol_program` reduces the
%      refutation `premises ∧ ¬conjecture` into the Horn fragment: the conjecture
%      ∀X.(a(X) → c(X)) is negated through the shared `gmeow_logic::entail::negate`
%      waist, whose fresh reserved-namespace witness w yields the asserted fact
%      a(w) and the goal c(w).
%   3. `gmeow_logic::proof_tree::prove_reasoning_program` resolves that goal with
%      the native proof-carrying SLG-WFS backward engine
%      (`gmeow_logic::physical::resolve_fol`) and VALIDATES every answer's proof
%      term with the Curry–Howard checker (`gmeow_logic::physical::proof::check`),
%      which independently re-derives each conclusion from its premises.
%   4. `ProofTree::to_tstp` projects the checked proof term to the lines below.
%
% The derivation of c(w) from a(w) IS the refutation: it contradicts the negated
% conjecture's ¬c(w).
%
% Reading the surface:
%   * Each step name `d_<hex>` is the exact image of that step's content-addressed
%     derivation IRI, `https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/derivation/<hex>` — the
%     SAME IRI `gmeow_logic::provenance::mint_derivation_id` mints for the forward
%     reasoner's rule application of the same firing.
%   * Predicates, constants, and inference-rule identities are IRIs, so they ride
%     as TPTP single-quoted atoms rather than being lossily shortened.
%   * An `inference(...)` rule IRI names the content-addressed GROUND-INSTANCE
%     firing (`.../logic/dag/firing/<blake3>`), which is what the proof checker
%     re-derives against.
%   * Leaves are `axiom` (asserted EDB facts); derived steps are `plain`.
cnf(d_7acf4e9d9037faca7a00b6151eb4528f6f41840d, axiom, 'https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tptp#a'('https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/entail/reserved#witness-d4a1e02579180296')).
cnf(d_29e8ab9f3c2b3beff56160d5073b6e6d7bee576c, plain, 'https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tptp#b'('https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/entail/reserved#witness-d4a1e02579180296'), inference('https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dag/firing/e2725dde7a7db00ec7148cbaaafee1829ca9c532df2ec8b8c59fbe0c2178a5fe', [status(thm)], [d_7acf4e9d9037faca7a00b6151eb4528f6f41840d])).
cnf(d_1ad92f008ebfa11c6dcc62cb8c78d2980e55afe4, plain, 'https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tptp#c'('https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/entail/reserved#witness-d4a1e02579180296'), inference('https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dag/firing/e333748014025c765c88458a6275b4b2e1ac78826b7f91e1defbff323ab982e3', [status(thm)], [d_29e8ab9f3c2b3beff56160d5073b6e6d7bee576c])).
